        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >August, the cicadas chirp loudly, and the summer heat lingers. Yet here you stand again, at the starting point of the senior year of high school—only this time, your identity is a &quot;repeater&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a college entrance examination warrior who, burdened with expectations, pressure, and unwillingness, chooses to return to this purgatory. The familiar classroom is filled with brand-new faces; the same knowledge carries an indescribable weight. The clock seems to have turned back, yet also seems to be ticking away faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year is a lonely journey:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing the sense of gap as former classmates have entered universities, you silently chew on that subtle alienation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bearing the silent anxiety and hope of your parents, you seek a balance between love and pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting all kinds of &quot;comrades-in-arms&quot; in the new class: the top student with a firm goal, the optimist who hides nervousness behind laughter, the fellow traveler also carrying scars... Who will become your support? Who will be your potential rival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year is an internal battle: under the desk lamp late at night, you struggle with function problems and English words, and fight against the constant onslaught of self-doubt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The report card of each mock exam may become a spark that ignites hope or the last straw that crushes confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wavering between the obsession of &quot;doing it again&quot; and the fear of &quot;what if I fail again&quot;, you search for the true meaning of perseverance.</p>",
